e Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"HuT7BNQum5g_rbXjwZqs3Q","review_id":"Q6JQDA6hhbbK8Ba1_FxXew","date":"2020-02-15T20:35:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.924551248550415,"text_excerpt":"Dined at the Zea's on Pontchartrain Blvd last week for their special Valentine's Day prix-fixe menu. For $49.99, you and your guest got one appetizer to share, two salads of your choice, and two entrees. All of the selections were diverse to appeal to a large crowd of people, and they were hefty portion sizes! To start, we got their Spinach Dip which is by far one of my favorite appetizers I've ever had. They're served alongside chips, but would be really amazing with pita bread - just a suggestion For salads we both got the Caesar, just a basic Caesar like you'd expect. Dinner options were various and ranged from fish dishes to chicken or pork. I got the Balsamic Salmon which came with t..."},{"business_id":"HuT7BNQum5g_rbXjwZqs3Q","review_id":"t3ICbXqFCwJvdSA9I3Ityg","date":"2018-01-21T22:09:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9241738319396973,"text_excerpt":"Needed to get something tasty and good today, so Zea was on my mind. Never been to this location before but was in neighborhood and gave them a try. I was not disappointed at all. Food was good and service was very friendly. The manager on duty, Kat gave excellent service, caring and very accommodating. Managers like her make you forget about any snafus you experience. I will be visiting again."},{"business_id":"HuT7BNQum5g_rbXjwZqs3Q","review_id":"NhlLQZx5scxf2weZKP4vGQ","date":"2018-06-19T13:54:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9212116003036499,"text_excerpt":"The Father's Day atmosphere was very nice. We had a party of 7 and the wait was about 30 minutes. Zea's is one of my favorite go-to restaurants where I'll stop to occasionally unwind or get a great meal with friends. This is one of their newest spots and it was smaller than the average, but very accommodating. The food is always great and I didn't expect anything less. The waitress seemed as though she was a bit nervous, but she did a fabulous job. I always order the rotisserie rib eye, it was cooked just right. I'll be back soon. Love the more convenient spot."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"HuT7BNQum5g_rbXjwZqs3Q","photo_id":"qWvTcQ8xvPCJpeKhJHKF7Q","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/qWvTcQ8xvPCJpeKhJHKF7Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9044405221939087},{"business_id":"HuT7BNQum5g_rbXjwZqs3Q","photo_id":"f4h0-M-2qORyNItKD7ZcmA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/f4h0-M-2qORyNItKD7ZcmA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8663368225097656},{"business_id":"HuT7BNQum5g_rbXjwZqs3Q","photo_id":"-pylTfJI07D_c5oVh7zPRw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-pylTfJI07D_c5oVh7zPRw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.85279744863510